  "readingSentences": [
    {
      "id": "reading-066-s001",
      "english": "According to ancient superstitions, moles reveal a person’s character.",
      "korean": "고대 미신에 따르면 점은 사람의 성격을 드러낸다."
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-066-s002",
      "english": "For example, a mole on one’s nose means that he or she is strong-willed and trustworthy.",
      "korean": "예를 들면 자신의 코위의 점은 그가 강한 의지의 소요자이거나 믿을만하다는 것을 의미한다."
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-066-s003",
      "english": "Moles are also believed to foretell the future.",
      "korean": "점은 또한 미래를 예언한다고 믿어진다."
    },
    {
      "id": "reading-066-s004",
      "english": "A good illustration of these is that Having a mole over one’s right eyebrow means he or she will be lucky with money and have a successful career. Other instance in this category include a mole on the hand, the most desired, forecasting talent, health, and happiness.",
      "korean": "이러한 것중의 중요하"
    }
  ],
